\u2014cast your bait into the water and start fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish of all sizes, rare species, and even bizarre mutated fish tainted by pollution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1d99765d6b7251749327a4cb6e874e59.avif?t=1768926056\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4765301214a572eb3d0aada4a843d3e5.avif?t=1768926056\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your farmland\u2014it will be your vital source of food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate crops you\u2019ve discovered from exploring other islands in your fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/29ec5c702e18c18062865cb5cd7edd06.avif?t=1768926056\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/ec0915dee53eea898598d14e0152b03e.avif?t=1768926056\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets are your best companions, ready to lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let them roam freely around your homestead, or pick one to adventure by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth and find pets across different islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/ae6d96b4dadb378c23d851b9f46ce9b4.avif?t=1768926056\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt